Mr.Sampson called to state that he is in the process of putting together a final proposal for the cleanup at the Hitching
Post.Hestated that he has questions about the disposal.
Does all of the concrete slab have togo as contaminated?What is the potential for recycling?I stated that as long as the
slab could be cleaned of all visible debris and wasn't covered with VAT&ma stic or block filler/sealant, then the concrete
could be considered non-asbestos.I stated that the potential to recycle would be primarily dependent on the coverings
that had been applied to the concrete.
