From:
Benjamin Luckey
To:
Jones, Tana
Cc:
Wyoming DEQ
Subject:
Records Request Received #1870231000001477010
Date:
Tuesday, January 2, 2018 8:36:40 AM
Ms. Jones,
Based on a cursory review of the databases for the Hazardous Waste Permitting/Corrective Action and Voluntary
Remediation Programs, there are no hazardous waste permitted/corrective action facilities or voluntary remediation
sites located at 1600 West Lincolnway, Cheyenne, WY.
There are the following VRP sites located nearby:
VRP 1017 - Conway, Inc, Former CNF - 1/2-mile west
VRP 2175 - Snyder Ave Properties - 1/2-mile east
VRP 2059 - Romero Park - 1/4-mile southeast
VRP 2134 - Tyrrell-Doyle Chevrolet (withdrawn) - 1/4-mile west
If you wish to view files related to these sites, please contact me so I can assemble them for
review.
For your future reference, sites participating in the Voluntary Remediation Program can be found on the sites list on our
website at:

http://deq.wyoming.gov/shwd/voluntary-remediation-program/resources/site-lists-maps/
Please contact me if you need additional information.
Regards,
--
Ben Luckey
Project Manager
Hazardous Waste Permitting and Corrective Action/VRP
Solid and Hazardous Waste Division
200 W. 17th Street
2nd Floor
Cheyenne, WY 82002
307-777-6186
benjamin.luckey@wyo.gov
E-Mail to and from me, in connection with the transaction
of public business, is subject to the Wyoming Public Records
Act and may be disclosed to third parties.
```

